{1}{Sir, please! Help me!}{Madam, please! Help me!}{}{}{}{}
{2}{What has happened to you?}{}{5}{lf1 0}{40}{lf1 1}
{3}{Who are you?}{}{5}{lf1 0}{40}{lf1 1}
{4}{Tell me, a nearby shack looks ready to collapse. Do you know anything about it?}{}{5}{lf1 0}{30}{lf1 1}
{6}{What you afraid?}{}{-4}{lf1 0}{40}{lf1 1}
{7}{Who you?}{}{-4}{lf1 0}{40}{lf1 1}
{8}{@pcname@ see shack outside almost broken. You know why?}{}{-4}{lf1 0}{30}{lf1 1}
{9}{I killed the monster in your attic.}{}{5}{qu1308 4, lf2 0}{140}{lf2 1, re +20}
{10}{Monster in attic dead.}{}{-4}{qu1308 4, lf2 0}{140}{lf2 1, re +20}
{11}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{30}{Of course I know... It is my fault...}{Of course I know... It is my fault...}{}{}{}{}
{31}{[He continues.]}{}{1}{}{40}{}
{40}{My name is Jacques Trowbridge. I study wood-eating insects. I keep many specimens in jars in my attic, some dead and others alive. Some are so voracious that merely setting their jar upon a wooden surface excites them enough to escape and devour the wood with astonishing speed...}{My name is Jacques Trowbridge. I study wood-eating insects. I keep many specimens in jars in my attic, some dead and others alive. Some are so voracious that merely setting their jar upon a wooden surface excites them enough to escape and devour the wood with astonishing speed...}{}{}{}{}
{41}{[He continues.]}{}{1}{}{50}{}
{50}{Unfortunately, I was away for some time, and when I returned I was horrified to discover that a monstrous creature had taken up residence in my attic! Worse still, outside near the neighboring shack I found one of my broken jars. It had contained some of my most voracious insects: wingless polyopterans...}{Unfortunately, I was away for some time, and when I returned I was horrified to discover that a monstrous creature had taken up residence in my attic! Worse still, outside near the neighboring shack I found one of my broken jars. It had contained some of my most voracious insects: wingless polyopterans...}{}{}{}{ru2253}
{51}{[He continues.]}{}{1}{}{60}{}
{60}{They were on the verge of devouring everything, but I managed to exterminate them quickly enough. Now I fear the monster in my attic may knock over more jars—this time beneath my own roof!... I see that you carry a weapon. Please, rid me of that monster! I can no longer sleep at night!...}{They were on the verge of devouring everything, but I managed to exterminate them quickly enough. Now I fear the monster in my attic may knock over more jars—this time beneath my own roof!... I see that you carry a weapon. Please, rid me of that monster! I can no longer sleep at night!...}{}{}{}{}
{61}{Fine.}{}{5}{}{120}{re +10, qu1308 2}
{62}{Have you seen this monster?}{}{5}{}{100}{}
{63}{What will I receive in exchange for my help?}{}{5}{}{80}{re -10, qu1308 1}
{64}{@pcname@ agree.}{}{-4}{}{120}{re +10, qu1308 2}
{65}{What monster look like?}{}{-4}{}{100}{}
{66}{What you give if me help?}{}{-4}{}{80}{re -10, qu1308 1}
{80}{Can you not see the poverty in which I live? Do you not understand how deeply this affair has distressed me? If you absolutely must receive something in return, then I have no need of your help. Thank you.}{Can you not see the poverty in which I live? Do you not understand how deeply this affair has distressed me? If you absolutely must receive something in return, then I have no need of your help. Thank you.}{}{}{}{}
{81}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{100}{It is terrifying, believe me. Admittedly, it's not often that I ventured beyond peaceful Malicorne and I have rarely encounter such hideous creatures. But truly, this monster is horribly malevolent!}{It is terrifying, believe me. Admittedly, it's not often that I ventured beyond peaceful Malicorne and I have rarely encounter such hideous creatures. But truly, this monster is horribly malevolent!}{}{}{}{}
{101}{Um... I'll help you.}{}{5}{}{120}{re +10, qu1308 2}
{102}{What will I receive in exchange for my help?}{}{5}{}{80}{re -10, qu1308 1}
{103}{@pcname@ agree.}{}{-4}{}{120}{re +10, qu1308 2}
{104}{What you give if me help?}{}{-4}{}{80}{re -10, qu1308 1}
{120}{Thank you, sir! I shall wait here. May God help you!}{Thank you, madam! I shall wait here. May God help you!}{}{}{}{}
{121}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{140}{Thank you so very much, sir! At last I can resume my life!}{Thank you so very much, madam! At last I can resume my life!}{}{}{}{}
{141}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{160}{I am eternally grateful to you, sir.}{I am eternally grateful to you, ma'am.}{}{}{}{}
